stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Comparing: Open existing stop evidence
  Comparing --> Reading: Refresh evidence
  Reading --> Comparing: Matching evidence arrives at same or newer snapshot time
  Reading --> Unavailable: Read fails
  Unavailable --> Reading: Retry read
  Comparing --> Reviewing: Submit human evidence
  Reviewing --> Refused: Authority refused
  Reviewing --> Unknown: Outcome unknown
  Reviewing --> Reading: Receipt confirmed
  Unknown --> Reviewing: Retry exact request
  Refused --> Reviewing: Submit corrected evidence
  Refused --> Reading: Refresh evidence
  Comparing --> Comparing: Select property with its freshest retained snapshot
  Reading --> Comparing: Select property with its freshest retained snapshot
  Unavailable --> Comparing: Select property with its freshest retained snapshot
  Refused --> Comparing: Select property with its freshest retained snapshot
  Reading --> Retired: Session ends
  Comparing --> Retired: Session ends
  Reviewing --> Retired: Session ends
  Unknown --> Retired: Session ends
  Refused --> Retired: Session ends
  Unavailable --> Retired: Session ends

%% Each property retains its own producer as-of version for this binding.
%% Refresh accepts only versions at least as new as the retained version.
%% Selection displays that property's retained version, never its initial version.
%% Older responses take the read-failure edge and leave retained snapshots unchanged.
%% never: Selection restores a snapshot older than the freshest accepted snapshot for that property.
%% Freshness transition coverage in test/tour-coordinate-review.browser.ts:
%% Matching same/newer response, selection after refresh, older response -> Unavailable,
%% Unavailable selection, and failed-read selection: both "coordinate refresh ... survives property selection and older reads" tests.
%% Refused selection: "coordinate review selects exact property, compares, refuses authority and retires at four viewports".
